Well, finally after weeks of waiting, the final patches showed up
yesterday. (1-12 + 12a for those who haven't seen it yet). After making
the requisite changes to config.h and the Makefile, I compiled it and
!WOW!, a first for hack on our Sys V machine - it worked with no hacks.
There is a problem in the makefile (for unix) though - there is a
circular dependency which I haven't bothered to go and find since it
still worked.

Anyway, I was very impressed to see every patch succeed and have the
thing compile and run the first try. (I've only just started a game as
WIZARD and haven't tried out everything yet though so I'm certain to run
into something...)

Again, congratulations.

